Output "out/background.gif"
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 12
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Hide
Type "kit tui --root $KIT_DEMO_ROOT"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show
Sleep 500ms
Type "Start a background compose call that sleeps 25 seconds then prints the git log, and while it runs tell me what calc.py exports."
Enter
Sleep 70s
Hide
Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
